Recommends: python3-uinput
Description: LuckyClick - Auto Clicker for Linux
 A feature-rich auto clicker for Linux with virtual mouse support,
 point recording, and system tray integration.
 Features:
  * Customizable click interval (hours, minutes, seconds, milliseconds)
  * Left, right, middle, and double click support
  * Global hotkeys (F4 for recording, F8 for start/stop)
  * Drag & drop point recording with real-time coordinates
  * Non-blocking click using virtual mouse (uinput)
  * System tray integration with auto-hide
  * Unlimited or limited click count
  * Random delay simulation
  * Save/load profiles
  * Bilingual interface (Vietnamese/English)